    "notes": [
      "The maximum of every subject is the TOTAL mark a gazette prints: theory plus internal assessment for the academic subjects, and theory plus practical for the skill subjects.",
      "A code can mean a different subject in a different class: 002 is Hindi Course-A in Class X and Hindi Elective in Class XII, 241 is Mathematics-Basic in Class X and Applied Mathematics in Class XII, and 122 is Sanskrit in Class X and Skill Education is never printed as 122.",
      "Codes that are not listed here are shown as Subject <code> and are never guessed."
    ]
